        {
            "id": "tradingview:248a97ce181bc:0",
            "title": "MYR Group posts updated investor presentation, reports record LTM revenue $4.01B and Q2 revenue $1.08B",
            "description": "<div class=\"body-bgeA9NCs body-pP5gm7BF content-pP5gm7BF\"><div class=\"symbolsContainer-rV5QygYP logosContainer-WbDJg_kR\" data-no-swipe=\"true\"></div><div><span><p class=\"\"><strong class=\"root-Tkn6WL2y\"><span>MYR Group posted updated investor presentation highlighting record LTM revenue of $4.01B and Q2 revenue of $1.08B.</span></strong></p><p class=\"\"><strong class=\"root-Tkn6WL2y\"><span>Key Highlights:</span></strong></p><ul class=\"list-bmN0_SHH list--padded-bmN0_SHH\"><li class=\"listItem-bmN0_SHH\"><span>Updated investor presentation furnished as Exhibit 99.1 under Regulation FD, used by management in Q3 2026 meetings.</span></li><li class=\"listItem-bmN0_SHH\"><span>Reported record LTM revenue of $4.01B and Q2 revenue of $1.08B; LTM net income $165.3M and diluted EPS $10.54.</span></li><li class=\"listItem-bmN0_SHH\"><span>Backlog reached $3.16B at June 30, 2026 with strong segment revenues: T&amp;D $2.10B, C&amp;I $1.91B.</span></li><li class=\"listItem-bmN0_SHH\"><span>Closed acquisition of Valley Electric and Comet Electric on July 1, 2026, expanding C&amp;I footprint and capabilities.</span></li><li class=\"listItem-bmN0_SHH\"><span>Balance sheet strength: $460M available under $490M credit facility ($226M after acquisition) and debt to LTM EBITDA leverage 0.03x.</span></li></ul><p class=\"\"><span>Original SEC Filing: </span><a class=\"link-zw5jRdec icon-zw5jRdec\" href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/700923/000070092326000044/myrg-20260807.htm\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">MYR GROUP INC. [ MYRG ] - 8-K - Aug. 07, 2026</a></p><section class=\"variant-secondary-Gmpzg_mv disclaimer-vMD6Mpww\"><b class=\"heading-wrapper-Gmpzg_mv\"><span class=\"heading-Gmpzg_mv\">Disclaimer</span></b><div class=\"content-Gmpzg_mv link-with-underline-Gmpzg_mv\"><span>This is an AI-powered summary. It may contain inaccuracies. Consider verifying important information with the source. Please note this summary is solely based on documents filed with the SEC.</span></div></section></span></div></div>",
